  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Admission of Refugees from Turkey to Germany</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is intended to provide comprehensive support to 3,000 beneficiaries of international protection identified by UNHCR in collaboration with the Turkish Directorate General of Migration Management (DGMM) and the German Federal Office for Migration and Refugees (BAMF) for humanitarian admission to Germany.</narrative>
